The '''ninja impling''' is a type of [[impling]] that can be caught at level 74 [[Hunter]] (or 84 Hunter if catching barehanded). Catching a ninja impling requires a [[Butterfly net|normal]] or [[magic butterfly net]] and some [[impling jar]]s. Capturing a ninja impling will grant the player either 50 Hunter experience if caught in Puro-Puro, or 240 if caught on Gielinor.

Ninja implings can be caught in the [[Impetuous Impulses]] [[minigame]], or when spotted throughout [[Puro-Puro]] or [[Gielinor]]. Once caught, the impling can be freed from the jar in exchange for an item, or can be given to Elnock Inquisitor for 3 empty impling jars, although this second option is not recommended.

==Rarity==
{{Main|Impling#Spawn_mechanics}}
On the Gielinor surface, ninja implings have a 1/100 chance to appear out of a mid-tier invisible spawn, as well as a 30/101 chance of appearing out of a high-tier invisible spawn. In Puro-Puro however, ninja implings have a 27/301 chance to emerge from one of the high-tier invisible spawns.

For a more detailed breakdown of impling spawn mechanics, see the main article.

